          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the other woman said, “Don't give it to either of us; go ahead and cut it in two.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.26",
